From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 06:25:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple: t8140-mcc: Add the T8132 compatible

T8132 has the same memory cache controller as T8140, reached through
two multicast apertures instead of per-plane blocks. List the T8132
compatible so the T8132 memory controller node can be described.

This is the MCC part of b811bfe35d ("dt-bindings: apple: describe
T8132 base controller variants") from the Aurora integration branch.
The rest of that commit is not needed here: this tree already lists the
T8132 PMC, CLPC and PMP compatibles, and its other hunks cover unrelated
controllers and T6041.

(partial cherry picked from commit b811bfe35d)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8140-mcc.yaml      | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8140-mcc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8140-mcc.yaml
index e4c5688a01..8d4c660937 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8140-mcc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8140-mcc.yaml
@@ -17,10 +17,12 @@ description:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-mcc
+    enum:
+      - apple,t8132-mcc
+      - apple,t8140-mcc
 
   reg:
-    description: The register block of each cache plane.
+    description: Per-plane blocks on T8140, or the two multicast apertures on T8132.
     minItems: 1
     maxItems: 8
 
